---
description: Take-home 2026 project-wide rules
alwaysApply: true
---
- Read `PROJECT_RULES.md`, `AI_POLICY.md`, and `VERSION_LOCK.md` before suggesting project-wide changes.
- Prefer the smallest change that satisfies the stated requirement.
- Do not add a dependency unless its need, source, version compatibility, and verification are clear.
- Separate observed facts, assumptions, and inferences.
- Never claim a command/test was run unless there is an observed result.
